{"audio": "galatians-05.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 157067, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1600, "text": "Galatians, Chapter Five."}, {"start_ms": 1600, "end_ms": 8667, "text": "Stand fast therefore in the liberty wherewith Christ hath made us free, and be not entangled again with the yoke of bondage."}, {"start_ms": 8667, "end_ms": 15067, "text": "Behold, I Paul say unto you, that if ye be circumcised, Christ shall profit you nothing."}, {"start_ms": 15067, "end_ms": 21467, "text": "For I testify again to every man that is circumcised, that he is a debtor to do the whole law."}, {"start_ms": 21467, "end_ms": 28667, "text": "Christ is become of no effect unto you, whosoever of you are justified by the law; ye are fallen from grace."}, {"start_ms": 28667, "end_ms": 33333, "text": "For we through the Spirit wait for the hope of righteousness by faith."}, {"start_ms": 33333, "end_ms": 41200, "text": "For in Jesus Christ neither circumcision availeth any thing, nor uncircumcision; but faith which worketh by love."}, {"start_ms": 41200, "end_ms": 46533, "text": "Ye did run well; who did hinder you that ye should not obey the truth?"}, {"start_ms": 46533, "end_ms": 49733, "text": "This persuasion cometh not of him that calleth you."}, {"start_ms": 49733, "end_ms": 51867, "text": "A little leaven leaveneth the whole lump."}, {"start_ms": 51867, "end_ms": 60533, "text": "I have confidence in you through the Lord, that ye will be none otherwise minded: but he that troubleth you shall bear his judgment, whosoever he be."}, {"start_ms": 60533, "end_ms": 65600, "text": "And I, brethren, if I yet preach circumcision, why do I yet suffer persecution?"}, {"start_ms": 65600, "end_ms": 68400, "text": "then is the offence of the cross ceased."}, {"start_ms": 68400, "end_ms": 71067, "text": "I would they were even cut off which trouble you."}, {"start_ms": 71067, "end_ms": 79333, "text": "For, brethren, ye have been called unto liberty; only use not liberty for an occasion to the flesh, but by love serve one another."}, {"start_ms": 79333, "end_ms": 86000, "text": "For all the law is fulfilled in one word, even in this; Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself."}, {"start_ms": 86000, "end_ms": 91467, "text": "But if ye bite and devour one another, take heed that ye be not consumed one of another."}, {"start_ms": 91467, "end_ms": 95467, "text": "This I say then, Walk in the Spirit, and ye shall not fulfil the lust of the flesh."}, {"start_ms": 95467, "end_ms": 105733, "text": "For the flesh lusteth against the Spirit, and the Spirit against the flesh: and these are contrary the one to the other: so that ye cannot do the things that ye would."}, {"start_ms": 105733, "end_ms": 109333, "text": "But if ye be led of the Spirit, ye are not under the law."}, {"start_ms": 109333, "end_ms": 128667, "text": "Now the works of the flesh are manifest, which are these; Adultery, fornication, uncleanness, lasciviousness, Idolatry, witchcraft, hatred, variance, emulations, wrath, strife, seditions, heresies, Envyings, murders, drunkenness, revellings, and such like: of the which I tell you before,"}, {"start_ms": 128667, "end_ms": 134800, "text": "as I have also told you in time past, that they which do such things shall not inherit the kingdom of God."}, {"start_ms": 134800, "end_ms": 143467, "text": "But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, gentleness, goodness, faith, Meekness, temperance: against such there is no law."}, {"start_ms": 143467, "end_ms": 148000, "text": "And they that are Christ's have crucified the flesh with the affections and lusts."}, {"start_ms": 148000, "end_ms": 151600, "text": "If we live in the Spirit, let us also walk in the Spirit."}, {"start_ms": 151600, "end_ms": 157067, "text": "Let us not be desirous of vain glory, provoking one another, envying one another."}], "words": [{"t": "Galatians,", "s": 61, "e": 628, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 709, "e": 1073, "si": 0}, {"t": "Five.", "s":